{"seq":2,"slug":"e-document-origin-cert","title":"原产地证等电子单证签发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/single-window-digital-customs-connect/sw-integration-api/e-document-origin-cert","wordCount":2221,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"原产地证等电子单证签发\">原产地证等电子单证签发</h1><p>报关数据里有一部分字段不是「申报人声明」，而是「另一个政府机关的决定」。原产地证书、检验检疫证书、濒危物种许可、农产品配额证明都属于这一类：它们由签发机关出具，申报时只是<strong>引用</strong>，而不是重新声明。把纸质证书搬到线上，工程上不是把扫描件替换成 PDF，而是把「一张纸」重构成一个<strong>有唯一标识、有生效期、有可用额度、可被核销、可被撤销</strong>的政务对象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-单证从文档变成对象\">核心概念：单证从文档变成对象</h2><p>纸质原产地证书的语义是自足的：纸上有签名与印章，谁持有原件谁就能主张优惠。电子化之后，语义必须由系统承载，于是产生了四个必须显式建模的属性。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>纸质形态下的对应物</th>\n<th>电子化后必须建模为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>唯一标识</td>\n<td>证书编号印制在纸上</td>\n<td>全局唯一证书号 + 签发机关标识</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生效期</td>\n<td>有效期手写在纸上</td>\n<td>notBefore / notAfter 时间区间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可用额度</td>\n<td>一张证书对应一批货</td>\n<td>可核销的数量或金额，随申报递减</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>撤销状态</td>\n<td>报失、作废需公告</td>\n<td>吊销标志 + 吊销时间 + 吊销原因码</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三项是电子化带来的最大语义增量。纸质证书「一张对一批货」，用掉即用完；电子证书可以对应可分割的额度，需要支持部分核销。这直接把证书变成了一个<strong>并发资源</strong>——多笔申报可能同时引用同一张证书的剩余额度，于是有了并发控制与超额风险。</p>\n<p>区域性的互认安排让这一点更加突出。东盟单一窗口连接并整合了东盟成员国的国家单一窗口，通过在各成员国之间实现边境贸易相关单证的电子交换来促进贸易；其上的 ATIGA 电子原产地证书（e-Form D）自 2019 年 12 月起由十国全部投入实盘运行，贸易商据此主张协定优惠税率；东盟报关单文件自 2020 年 12 月起开始实盘交换（<a href=\"https://asw.asean.org/\">ASEAN Single Window</a>）。跨境互认意味着一张证书的权威同时被两个国家的系统承认，任何一方的核销都必须被另一方感知——这把额度管理的并发问题从单国扩展到了跨境。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  subgraph 签发机关侧&#10;    A[申请/审核] --&gt; B[签发电子证书]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;证书对象: 编号 / 有效期 / 额度&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;推送给单一窗口或海关系统&quot;]&#10;  end&#10;  subgraph 企业侧&#10;    E[申报时引用证书号] --&gt; F[&quot;预扣额度 HELD&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G{汇合结果}&#10;    G --&gt;|放行| H[&quot;确认核销 CONSUMED&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt;|拦截或撤回| I[&quot;释放额度 RELEASED&quot;]&#10;  end&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  H --&gt; J[&quot;额度余额 = 初始额度 - 已占用&quot;]&#10;  I --&gt; J\">graph TD\n  subgraph 签发机关侧\n    A[申请/审核] --&gt; B[签发电子证书]\n    B --&gt; C[\"证书对象: 编号 / 有效期 / 额度\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"推送给单一窗口或海关系统\"]\n  end\n  subgraph 企业侧\n    E[申报时引用证书号] --&gt; F[\"预扣额度 HELD\"]\n    F --&gt; G{汇合结果}\n    G --&gt;|放行| H[\"确认核销 CONSUMED\"]\n    G --&gt;|拦截或撤回| I[\"释放额度 RELEASED\"]\n  end\n  D --&gt; E\n  H --&gt; J[\"额度余额 = 初始额度 - 已占用\"]\n  I --&gt; J</pre><p>这张图里最关键的一跳是 <code>D</code>：证书数据通常由签发机关主动推送给海关或窗口，而不是由企业转交。这一跳决定了一个重要的架构事实——<strong>企业系统里的证书副本永远是对政务系统的投影，不是权威</strong>。任何以本地副本为准的额度判断都会在并发或延迟下出错。</p>\n<h2 id=\"电子单证的引用模型\">电子单证的引用模型</h2><p>申报引用单证的正确方式是把单证当作<strong>外部实体引用</strong>，而不是把它的内容复制进申报报文。复制内容会带来三个问题：额度无法在政务侧统一扣减、证书变更（撤销、更正）无法传导、以及同一份证书在不同申报中可能出现不一致的副本。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;declarationId&quot;: &quot;DCL-2026-000123&quot;,&#10;  &quot;documentReferences&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;docType&quot;: &quot;CERTIFICATE_OF_ORIGIN&quot;,&#10;      &quot;docId&quot;: &quot;CO-2026-CN-000088213&quot;,&#10;      &quot;issuingAuthority&quot;: &quot;CN-CCPIT&quot;,&#10;      &quot;issueDate&quot;: &quot;2026-09-01&quot;,&#10;      &quot;validUntil&quot;: &quot;2027-03-01&quot;,&#10;      &quot;claimedPreference&quot;: &quot;FTA-ASEAN&quot;,&#10;      &quot;declaredQuantity&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: 40, &quot;unit&quot;: &quot;PCE&quot; },&#10;      &quot;verifyMode&quot;: &quot;PUSH_REFERENCE&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;docType&quot;: &quot;PHYTOSANITARY_CERTIFICATE&quot;,&#10;      &quot;docId&quot;: &quot;PHY-2026-NL-77120&quot;,&#10;      &quot;issuingAuthority&quot;: &quot;NL-NVWA&quot;,&#10;      &quot;issueDate&quot;: &quot;2026-09-10&quot;,&#10;      &quot;validUntil&quot;: &quot;2026-10-10&quot;,&#10;      &quot;claimedPreference&quot;: null,&#10;      &quot;declaredQuantity&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: 12.4, &quot;unit&quot;: &quot;KGM&quot; },&#10;      &quot;verifyMode&quot;: &quot;PUSH_REFERENCE&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"declarationId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DCL-2026-000123\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"documentReferences\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"docType\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CERTIFICATE_OF_ORIGIN\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"docId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CO-2026-CN-000088213\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"issuingAuthority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CN-CCPIT\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"issueDate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"validUntil\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2027-03-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"claimedPreference\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FTA-ASEAN\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"declaredQuantity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"unit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PCE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"verifyMode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PUSH_REFERENCE\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"docType\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PHYTOSANITARY_CERTIFICATE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"docId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PHY-2026-NL-77120\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"issuingAuthority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"NL-NVWA\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"issueDate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-10\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"validUntil\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-10-10\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"claimedPreference\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"declaredQuantity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12.4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"unit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"KGM\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"verifyMode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PUSH_REFERENCE\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>verifyMode</code> 字段表达的是「窗口如何去验证这份引用」，实践中至少有两种：<strong>PUSH_REFERENCE</strong>（签发机关已把证书推送给窗口，窗口按编号直接查到全部要素，企业只需给编号）与 <strong>FULL_PAYLOAD</strong>（窗口没有收到推送，企业必须提交证书要素，由窗口向签发机关核验）。两种模式的字段集与失败模式完全不同，必须在接口设计中显式区分。</p>\n<h3 id=\"长度校验与要素比对\">长度校验与要素比对</h3><p>当证书是 FULL_PAYLOAD 时，窗口会做要素比对：申报中的货物描述、数量单位、收货人是否与证书一致。这是电子化之前的「单证一致」审查的机器版本。企业侧应当提前做同样的比对，避免把必然会失败的申报送出去——理由与 <a href=\"../single-window-model/one-submit-multi-agency\">一次申报与多部门复用的数据模型</a> 中的前置冲突检测一致，只是检查对象从申报内部一致性变成了跨对象一致性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 跨对象一致性：申报货物与所引用证书的要素必须兼容&#10;SELECT d.declaration_id, r.doc_id, &#39;quantity_exceeds_certificate&#39; AS defect&#10;FROM declaration_document_ref r&#10;JOIN declaration_goods d&#10;  ON d.declaration_id = r.declaration_id&#10; AND d.unit_code = r.declared_unit&#10;WHERE r.verify_mode = &#39;FULL_PAYLOAD&#39;&#10;  AND d.qty &gt; r.declared_quantity&#10;UNION ALL&#10;SELECT r.declaration_id, r.doc_id, &#39;certificate_expired_at_declaration&#39;&#10;FROM declaration_document_ref r&#10;WHERE r.valid_until &lt; :declarationDate;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 跨对象一致性：申报货物与所引用证书的要素必须兼容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">declaration_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">doc_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'quantity_exceeds_certificate'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> defect</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> declaration_document_ref r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> declaration_goods d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">declaration_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">declaration_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unit_code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">declared_unit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">verify_mode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'FULL_PAYLOAD'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">qty</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">declared_quantity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UNION ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">declaration_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">doc_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'certificate_expired_at_declaration'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> declaration_document_ref r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">valid_until</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :declarationDate;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"额度核销-一个必须显式并发的资源\">额度核销：一个必须显式并发的资源</h2><p>额度核销是本篇最核心的工程问题。它的失败模式很清晰：两笔申报同时读到同一张证书的剩余额度、各自判断「够用」、各自扣减，结果总额超用。政务侧通常也会做校验，但企业的订单已经生成、货已经发出，超用被发现的时刻往往已经很晚。</p>\n<h3 id=\"为什么必须在本地做预扣\">为什么必须在本地做预扣</h3><p>有人会主张「核销交给政务侧，本地只读」。这在单一渠道、串行申报的场景里成立，但在多平台、多服务实例、并发申报的场景里不成立：政务侧的核销结果要通过异步回执回来，中间有几十秒到几分钟的延迟窗口，期间本地无法知道额度是否已被消耗。<strong>在这个窗口里必须有本地预扣</strong>，否则超用概率随并发度线性上升。</p>\n<p>预扣的语义要与 <a href=\"../single-window-model/customs-port-inspection-tax\">海关/口岸/检验/税费联办</a> 中的三段式严格一致：HELD（预扣，尚未定论）、CONSUMED（政务确认核销）、RELEASED（拦截或撤回后释放）。三类状态的可校验不变量是：<strong>已占用 = SUM(HELD) + SUM(CONSUMED) ≤ 初始额度</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 预扣必须在同一事务内做「读取余额 + 插入预扣」，并串行化同一证书的并发&#10;BEGIN;&#10;SELECT initial_qty FROM certificate WHERE cert_id = :certId FOR UPDATE;&#10;SELECT COALESCE(SUM(qty), 0) AS held&#10;  FROM certificate_quota_hold&#10; WHERE cert_id = :certId AND state IN (&#39;HELD&#39;,&#39;CONSUMED&#39;);&#10;&#10;-- 应用层判定 held + :qty &lt;= initial_qty，不满足则回滚并返回超用错误&#10;INSERT INTO certificate_quota_hold (cert_id, declaration_id, qty, state, held_at)&#10;VALUES (:certId, :declarationId, :qty, &#39;HELD&#39;, now());&#10;COMMIT;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 预扣必须在同一事务内做「读取余额 + 插入预扣」，并串行化同一证书的并发</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> initial_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> certificate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cert_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :certId </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FOR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(qty), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> held</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> certificate_quota_hold</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cert_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :certId </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'HELD'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CONSUMED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 应用层判定 held + :qty &#x3C;= initial_qty，不满足则回滚并返回超用错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> certificate_quota_hold (cert_id, declaration_id, qty, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">state</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, held_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (:certId, :declarationId, :qty, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'HELD'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">COMMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>FOR UPDATE</code> 锁住的是证书行，不是预扣表：这样做让同一证书的并发预扣串行化，同时不影响不同证书之间的并行。这是典型的「按资源分片的行锁」用法，比对整张表加锁或依赖数据库序列可扩展得多。</p>\n<h3 id=\"释放与超时的处置\">释放与超时的处置</h3><p>预扣之后如果申报长期没有结论（回执丢失、政务系统故障、人工挂起），额度会一直被占用。必须有<strong>预扣租约</strong>：HELD 记录带一个 <code>expires_at</code>，超过租约期限仍未转为 CONSUMED 的预扣，由对账任务扫描并标记为「待确认」状态，进入人工或自动核对流程。直接释放是危险的——万一申报其实已经放行了，释放会造成超用；直接保持占用也是危险的——额度会被长期错误占用。折中做法是把它们挑出来，而不是二选一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"撤销-更正与状态传导\">撤销、更正与状态传导</h2><p>电子证书最容易被低估的特性是<strong>可变</strong>。签发机关可以在证书签发后撤销它（发现申报不实），也可以更正（发现笔误）。这些变更会沿 <code>签发机关 → 窗口/海关 → 企业</code> 的链路传导，而企业侧通常是通过单证状态查询或推送才得知。</p>\n<p>状态传导的工程要求有两条：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>已使用该证书的申报必须被识别出来</strong>。这要求维护「证书 → 引用它的申报」的反向索引，而不是只存申报到证书的正向引用。反向索引让撤销事件能够触发受影响申报的评估。</li>\n<li><strong>撤销的处置不能一律是「拦截」</strong>。如果货已放行，撤销的后果是补税或行政处罚，而不是阻止放行；如果申报尚未放行，则应当拦截。因此撤销事件的处理必须依据受影响申报的当前状态分流，这与 <a href=\"../sw-ops-governance/sw-data-consistency-reconcile\">申报数据一致性与对账</a> 中「以政务状态为准并分类处置」的方法同一套逻辑。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 反向索引：证书被撤销时找出受影响的申报及其当前业务状态&#10;SELECT r.declaration_id, d.state, d.released_at, r.declared_quantity&#10;FROM declaration_document_ref r&#10;JOIN declaration d ON d.declaration_id = r.declaration_id&#10;WHERE r.doc_id = :revokedDocId&#10;ORDER BY d.released_at NULLS FIRST;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 反向索引：证书被撤销时找出受影响的申报及其当前业务状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">declaration_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">state</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">released_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">declared_quantity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> declaration_document_ref r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> declaration d </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">declaration_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">declaration_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">doc_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :revokedDocId</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">released_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULLS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FIRST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>released_at NULLS FIRST</code> 把尚未放行的申报排在最前面——它们是必须立即处置的；已放行的申报排在后面，走事后补救流程。一个 <code>ORDER BY</code> 里就装下了分流的优先级。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>电子单证不是「扫描件」，而是<strong>有编号、有效期、可用额度、可撤销状态</strong>的政务对象；额度属性是电子化带来的核心语义增量。</li>\n<li>申报应<strong>引用</strong>单证而非复制内容；引用要区分 PUSH_REFERENCE 与 FULL_PAYLOAD 两种验证模式，它们的字段集与失败模式不同。</li>\n<li>额度是并发资源，<strong>本地预扣不可省</strong>：政务侧核销结果的回传延迟窗口里，没有预扣就没有并发保护。</li>\n<li>预扣沿用三段式状态，不变量是 <code>SUM(HELD) + SUM(CONSUMED) ≤ 初始额度</code>；并发控制用证书行级 <code>FOR UPDATE</code> 分片。</li>\n<li>长期无结论的预扣要有<strong>租约</strong>，超期后转为「待确认」而非直接释放或永久占用。</li>\n<li>证书可变，必须有<strong>反向索引</strong>识别受影响申报，并按申报当前状态（是否已放行）分流处置。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下一篇：见 <a href=\"message-ack-status-normalize\">报文确认与状态归集</a>，看这些单证操作产生的多层确认如何被归一化成一个企业可用的状态。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"原产地证等电子单证签发","id":"原产地证等电子单证签发"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：单证从文档变成对象","id":"核心概念-单证从文档变成对象"},{"level":2,"text":"电子单证的引用模型","id":"电子单证的引用模型"},{"level":3,"text":"长度校验与要素比对","id":"长度校验与要素比对"},{"level":2,"text":"额度核销：一个必须显式并发的资源","id":"额度核销-一个必须显式并发的资源"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么必须在本地做预扣","id":"为什么必须在本地做预扣"},{"level":3,"text":"释放与超时的处置","id":"释放与超时的处置"},{"level":2,"text":"撤销、更正与状态传导","id":"撤销-更正与状态传导"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"单一窗口接口与证书认证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/single-window-digital-customs-connect/sw-integration-api/sw-interface-auth-cert"},"next":{"title":"报文确认与状态归集","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/single-window-digital-customs-connect/sw-integration-api/message-ack-status-normalize"}}